<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Alpha, Blue Circle not to merge.</title>
<headline>Alpha, Blue Circle not to merge.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African cement producers Aplha Ltd and Blue Circle, a unit of Murray &amp; Roberts Holdings Ltd, confirmed on Monday that they had decided not to proceed with a proposed merger.</p>
<p>The announcement had been expected following a decision by the Minister of Trade and Industry to accept the Competition Board's recommendation that the planned link-up should not be allowed.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
